{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46166","headline":"鹭鸶有怀 · 贯休","name":"鹭鸶有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粉魄霜华爲尔枯，鸳鸯相伴更堪图。\n爱来沙岛遗银屋，终作金笼养雪雏。\n栖宿必多清濑梦，品流还次白猨徒。\n今朝不觉频回首，曾伴瑶花近玉壶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}